<title>UK: EU rejects bids to sell German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU rejects bids to sell German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday rejected all bids in the weekly export tender to export German intervention rye to non-EU countries, member country officials said.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
